%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d1216ff7750a7055067a44fccc35d0d5 3x"}, "body": "Hello, thank you for the appeal ^^\n\nI'm glad you've taken interest in my OC, Kirani, and I would love an artwork of her in your style\n\nShe's a young woman who is able to control living plants and became the queen of the forest\n\nHer personality is vengeful, have difficulties in trusting others, yet still kind to those close to her\n\nShe become like this after her childhood friend betrayed her by burning down her forest\n\nOther details:\n- She have fireflies that follows her around and guides her\n\nYou can draw her however you like in whatever pose you want\n\nThank you for your time ^^\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1GFBq-x7exAlCNipgsk1ZmXNqZXEgRM1r", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@muromachi/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2824027, "client_id": 2976369, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3193b62e30c6cf048045e6847110a80c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3193b62e30c6cf048045e6847110a80c, https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=57548e701308288b050d7a1af7d2ad2e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53d2643ca0f398a2abb96f7dd45702d1 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=662d3e88a6d7f08bfd036cee3ff59df8", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=662d3e88a6d7f08bfd036cee3ff59df8, https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3d1dae176cb86696ba0ed19721638150 2x, https://si.imgix.net/9e9a26c1/uploads/origins/3b26dc09-048f-48f7-a5d9-e84e311984b9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f7fddadc86ed4e9fdf8685925f8027dd 3x"}, "body": "Thank you so much for the appeal!! Your art style is stunning! I checked your art on your socials and I'd be honored if you drew my original character, Dorian, like you mentioned. ^^\n\nYou may draw him however you like, I'll leave the details and composition up to you! I'd love to see what you come up with. \n\nIf it helps his height is 180.34 cm and he is 25 years old. Recurring motifs for him are eyes and crosses. \n\nThank you again for your appeal and for your consideration ! \u2661\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/160vDHWEvPc0OlhzxKg85HOMFT5RB_C3S", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@muromachi/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2824027, "client_id": 1150684, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3970128d/uploads/origins/d92e36bd-d847-485a-886d-29cb4fbe8301?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69867e903444ea66ff0b245abb81cd6f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3970128d/uploads/origins/d92e36bd-d847-485a-886d-29cb4fbe8301?bg=%23fff&aut